cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GrantScape, please cite it as below."
title: "GrantScape: an open tool for navigating the NIH funding landscape"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, browser-based tool that integrates public NIH data
  (RCDC categorical spending, Institute/Center success rates, and RePORTER
  funded projects) to show what NIH funds, where funding is growing, and
  which institutes and study sections fund a given research area.
